{%- comment -%}
  Rosalia · Funnel asset loader (styles)
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  Rendered at the top of every rosalia-funnel-* section, so each section
  is self-contained: it can be added, moved, duplicated or hidden in the
  editor and still bring its own styles.

  No stock theme file is modified to make the funnel work.

  The <link> resolves to one URL, so repeating it across sections costs
  one fetch, not one per section.

  The behaviour script is deliberately NOT here — see
  `rosalia-funnel-behaviour`, which only the two sections that actually
  need JavaScript render.
{%- endcomment -%}
